# A pin deliberately left stale, for _test-update-direnv-dependencies.yml.
#
# DO NOT REFRESH THE PIN BELOW. A fixture pinned to the latest version would make the
# whole test pass by having nothing to upgrade - the assertion that `changed` is true
# would then be asserting nothing. The assertions name 0.40.0, so changing it breaks them.
#
# No pixi workspace accompanies it: update-direnv-dependencies.yml never evaluates the
# .envrc, so the directive is the only thing that has to be here.
use pixi 0.40.0
